---
import '../styles/global.css'
---

<section class="py-[68px]">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5">
        <div class="text-center" data-anim>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-red mb-3.5">Validated by the community</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-[38px] font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3.5">Trusted by <em class="not-italic text-red">Real Advisory Firms</em></h2>
          <p class="max-w-[58ch] mx-auto mb-10 text-text-dim text-[16.5px]">&nbsp;</p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-[30px] gap-y-3 text-sm font-bold text-text-dim mb-9 text-center" data-anim>
          <div><b class="text-gold-deep">#1 Workflow Tool</b>. T3 2025 &amp; 2026</div>
          <div><b class="text-gold-deep">Highest Rated CRM</b>. 9.47 user score</div>
          <div><b class="text-gold-deep">Advicer's Choice</b>. XYPN AdviceTech</div>
          <div><b class="text-gold-deep">2× Mighty Mite</b> winner</div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-5.5">
          <div data-anim style="--d:0.00s">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-ink rounded-custom flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 text-[#C89A94] text-center cursor-pointer" data-video="TESTIMONIAL_VIDEO_1">
              <span class="w-13 h-13 rounded-full bg-gold text-ink flex items-center justify-center text-lg pl-1">▶</span>
              <small class="text-[11.5px] leading-tight">Video testimonial<br>(swap in TESTIMONIAL_VIDEO_1)</small>
            </div>
            <cite class="block not-italic text-xs font-extrabold mt-2.5">Eric Nelson, CFP® <span class="block font-medium text-text-dim">Independence Wealth</span></cite>
          </div>

          <div data-anim style="--d:0.08s">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-ink rounded-custom flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 text-[#C89A94] text-center cursor-pointer" data-video="TESTIMONIAL_VIDEO_2">
              <span class="w-13 h-13 rounded-full bg-gold text-ink flex items-center justify-center text-lg pl-1">▶</span>
              <small class="text-[11.5px] leading-tight">Video testimonial<br>(swap in TESTIMONIAL_VIDEO_2)</small>
            </div>
            <cite class="block not-italic text-xs font-extrabold mt-2.5">Steven Schoenberger, CFP®, JD <span class="block font-medium text-text-dim">Open Door Financial</span></cite>
          </div>

          <div data-anim style="--d:0.16s">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-ink rounded-custom flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 text-[#C89A94] text-center cursor-pointer" data-video="TESTIMONIAL_VIDEO_3">
              <span class="w-13 h-13 rounded-full bg-gold text-ink flex items-center justify-center text-lg pl-1">▶</span>
              <small class="text-[11.5px] leading-tight">Video testimonial<br>(swap in TESTIMONIAL_VIDEO_3)</small>
            </div>
            <cite class="block not-italic text-xs font-extrabold mt-2.5">Gina Mayclin <span class="block font-medium text-text-dim">Cipolla Financial Advisors</span></cite>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white border border-line border-t-3 border-t-red rounded-custom p-6" data-anim style="--d:0.00s">
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-3.5">"Since adopting Quivr, I've saved myself at least 2-3 hours of administrative work per week. Projects like client deliverables are taking half as much time."</p>
            <cite class="block not-italic text-xs font-extrabold">Eric Nelson, CFP®<span class="block font-medium text-text-dim">Independence Wealth</span></cite>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-line border-t-3 border-t-red rounded-custom p-6" data-anim style="--d:0.08s">
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-3.5">"Out-of-the-box, Quivr is far more powerful than our previous system, improving planning and efficiency. The Community is a great resource, and the team implements enhancements we request."</p>
            <cite class="block not-italic text-xs font-extrabold">Steven Schoenberger, CFP®, JD<span class="block font-medium text-text-dim">Open Door Financial</span></cite>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-line border-t-3 border-t-red rounded-custom p-6" data-anim style="--d:0.16s">
            <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-3.5">"Our office loves Quivr! It's simple, clean, and keeps our meetings and planning organized, while still offering the unique bells and whistles that other CRMs don't have."</p>
            <cite class="block not-italic text-xs font-extrabold">Gina Mayclin<span class="block font-medium text-text-dim">Cipolla Financial Advisors</span></cite>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>